Navigation|Ctrl+H|Navigate left (nvim split / tmux pane)
Navigation|Ctrl+J|Navigate down (nvim split / tmux pane)
Navigation|Ctrl+K|Navigate up (nvim split / tmux pane)
Navigation|Ctrl+L|Navigate right (nvim split / tmux pane)
Neovim Resize|Ctrl+W H|Resize split left (-5 cols)
Neovim Resize|Ctrl+W J|Resize split down (-3 rows)
Neovim Resize|Ctrl+W K|Resize split up (+3 rows)
Neovim Resize|Ctrl+W L|Resize split right (+5 cols)
Neovim Reposition|Ctrl+W Left|Move split to far left
Neovim Reposition|Ctrl+W Down|Move split to bottom
Neovim Reposition|Ctrl+W Up|Move split to top
Neovim Reposition|Ctrl+W Right|Move split to far right
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W S|Split horizontally
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W V|Split vertically
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W Q|Close split
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W =|Equalize splits
Neovim Splits|Ctrl+W O|Close all other splits
Tmux Resize|prefix+h|Resize pane left (repeatable)
Tmux Resize|prefix+j|Resize pane down (repeatable)
Tmux Resize|prefix+k|Resize pane up (repeatable)
Tmux Resize|prefix+l|Resize pane right (repeatable)
Tmux Splits|prefix+"|Split pane horizontally
Tmux Splits|prefix+%|Split pane vertically
Tmux Splits|prefix+X|Close pane
Tmux Panes|prefix+{|Swap pane with previous
Tmux Panes|prefix+}|Swap pane with next
Tmux Panes|prefix+Space|Cycle pane layout
Tmux Panes|prefix+Z|Toggle pane zoom
Tmux Windows|prefix+C|New window
Tmux Windows|prefix+N|Next window
Tmux Windows|prefix+P|Previous window
Tmux Windows|prefix+W|Window list
Tmux Windows|prefix+<number>|Go to window <number>
Tmux Windows|prefix+&|Close window
